    "description": "<p><em>See Figurine of Wondrous Power</em></p><p>These gold statuettes of lions are always created in pairs. You can use one figurine or both simultaneously. Each can become a <strong>Lion</strong> for up to 1 hour. Once a lion has been used, it can't be used again until 7 days have passed.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-e1wLN4czlgS5CpcW\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Each <strong>Use Lion</strong> activity has limited uses which represent the 7 days required before that particular paired figurine can be used again.</p></section>",
